/archived/

# This repository dogfoods its own decision records: all four lifecycle
# directories under `adr/` are tracked and shared. A writer killed mid-write
# leaves its per-number lock behind (recovery: remove it by hand once no
# writer is running); the file is local state, never shared.
adr/.write-*.lock
*.tgz
.DS_Store
*.log

.idea/
.workbuddy/

# Generated agent integration target (adrkit init/update) plus local-only
# skills; the committed sources live in skills/.
.agents/

# Local artifacts kept out of the shared tree, such as the competitor-research
# reading PDF cited by its openspec change.
/output/

# Browser regression output
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
